{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2023-02-16 08:51:00', 'title': 'LEIDOS, INC. COMMENCES TENDER OFFER FOR ANY AND ALL 2.950% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2023', 'text': 'RESTON, VA. , FEB. 16, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEIDOS HOLDINGS, INC. (NYSE:LDOS) ("HOLDINGS"), A FORTUNE® 500 SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY, LEIDOS, INC. ("LEIDOS"), HAS COMMENCED AN OFFER TO PURCHASE FOR CASH (THE "TENDER OFFER") ANY AND ALL OF ITS OUTSTANDING 2.950% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2023 (THE "2023 NOTES").'}